 * Component gameplay-menus v1 (MenuManager): holder-based menu inventories. A menu inventory is recognised ONLY by its
 * holder (a Holder object of this plugin), never by its title. Click hardening: EVERY InventoryClickEvent and
 * InventoryDragEvent whose top inventory is a menu is cancelled, at LOWEST (other plugins see it cancelled) and again at
 * HIGHEST (nobody can un-cancel it before MONITOR): clicks in the player's own inventory, shift-clicks, number keys,
 * off-hand swaps, double clicks, drops, middle/creative clicks and drags all do nothing. Only a plain LEFT or RIGHT click
 * on a menu slot runs a button, at most once per general.menu_click_cooldown_ticks per player, in the fixed order
